	(text "The diode over the LED is to protect against reversed connection or AC voltage.\n\nThe sensor is place in Baustein 15 pressed down all the way to the bottom.\nFour 2.5mm holes at the backside together with the holes in the PCB provide the\nuse of the Märklin/Fischertechnik connectors. "
